<title>JAPAN: JR West shares hit record high in morning Tokyo.</title>
<headline>JR West shares hit record high in morning Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of West Japan Railway Co hit a record high in Friday morning trade, as dealers joined domestic investors in buying the shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0146 GMT, the shares were up 6,000 yen at 389,000.</p>
<p>&quot;These past couple of days, domestic investors have been attracted to the shares and dealers are starting to follow them,&quot; a trader at a second-tier brokerage said.</p>
</text>
